				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>対戦を　終了します
しばらく　お待ちください</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>通信終了時のメッセージ。</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:20" />
		</CommentCell>
